# Channels:
All four customer channels(Google Ads, Meta Ads, Organic, Referral) look alike on fulfilment( arround 82%), cancellation (about 5%), rating (about 4.26),
price and hours, and the same holds inside each city.

# City:
Lyon fulfills 61% against Paris, Lille and Bordeaux. This gap holds for each month and every job length. So, it is not about timing. 
The cause is the capacity. In june 2026, Lyon had arround 49 requests per active cleaner against 23 in Paris, 19 in Lille and 14 in Bordeaux. 
Cleaners are overloaded. 

# Period:
Fulfilment is stable at 82–86% after launch; the Q1 2025 decrease reflect Lyon starting with 4–12 cleaners. Lyon is getting worse, with the unfulfilled share rising from 31% in 2025 to 37% in 2026, as demand outgrows supply.
